# Sega CD map (segacd_game.cpp, map mode): SEE DUNE MAP (first row) opens
# the map centred on the palace (white marker) with the map panel (globe
# block, blue tint, map pad); the pad's right arrow scrolls east; a tap on
# the sietch marker east of the palace (place 11) travels there; the
# sietch's first room shows.
wait 1500
move 120 180
click left 120 180
wait 1000
checkpoint segacd-map-open
move 290 200
click left 290 200
wait 1000
checkpoint segacd-map-scrolled
move 120 180
click left 120 180
wait 800
move 120 180
click left 120 180
wait 1000
move 304 84
click left 304 84
wait 1000
checkpoint segacd-map-travel
quit
